WEBVTT

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.500
A pop and a step and I've gotcha!

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.650
Let's put on another flashy concert today!

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.370
Mega-niisan?!

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.030
A patrolling Mega-niisan?!

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.570
Should you really be playing around, Mega-nii?

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.570
I'm not playing around.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.630
It looks like you are to me-pri.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.720
<i>This time I stole your heart.</i>

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>Autumn is just around the corner.</i>

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:37.110
Phantom Thief Genius said he'd be back this autumn!

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:40.720
Get out there and catch him so I don't have to worry about winning!

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.870
I've already come up with a way to deal with Phantom Thief Genius.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:46.520
That's why I'm patrolling like this.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.420
And on top of that, I've put in a request to the Parajuku PriPara Police...

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.110
...to dispatch the PriPara Police!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:55.070
PriPara Police?

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:29.070
Ham and Ajimi.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.420
PriPara Police?

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.590
Our police force is top-notch,

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.480
so there's nothing to worry about.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.260
And with that, I'll go back to patrolling.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.620
The PriPara Police, huh?

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:45.910
I wonder what kind of people will show up?

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:52.730
Candy À La Mode has a new brand for the artist who loves painting pictures.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:56.900
The cute poppin' Candy À La Mode More fits her perfectly!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.360
PriPara Change complete!

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.880
DaVinci!

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.160
Wha?

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.250
S-She sure looked like a cute idol...

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.040
A blooming of colour.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.460
It was a colourful coord.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.680
I've never seen her before-pri.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.170
Could that girl be part of the PriPara Police?

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.780
I don't think so...

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:24.660
She's got to be!

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:27.280
Within minutes of Mega-nii calling the police,

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.340
a new idol appeared.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.480
There's no refuting my reasoning.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:33.300
You could be right.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.230
So she's with the police-pri...

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.630
You're dazzling-picasso!

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.320
Let's play-daVinci!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.480
There's no way-pri.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.190
What the heck did she say?

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.200
Play?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.790
Wah!

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.480
Yehello!

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.560
I'm Kigi Ajimi!

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.000
Today is my PriPara début-daVinci!

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.860
N-Nice to capisce ya.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:01.820
Hey now!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.850
Lala's face isn't your sketchbook-pri.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:05.970
Wha?!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.890
What's the big idea?!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.820
Everything shiny-shiny, frilly-frilly, sparkly-sparkly...

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:17.530
and cute-daVinci!

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.060
Autumn of art.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.600
So Munch creativity flowing-klimtDaVinci.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.770
Doesn't seem like she's listening.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:25.770
She's sure going about at her own pace.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:28.830
Anyway, don't paint graffiti on the wall-pri!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.330
Heart jumping dancing-daVinci!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:37.320
S-She's using a sentence ender, so I guess that makes her a sentence ender idol-pri.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.600
She has too many enders.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.100
I haven't a clue what she's saying.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.370
It's crazier than Mirei's pri.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:48.170
At any rate, she seems to be using artist's names-pri.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.560
Picasso, Da Vinci...

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:53.520
Since she paints pictures, her sentence ender is "daVinci"?

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.330
Who the Vinci is Da Vinci?

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.050
It's not who-pri!

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:01.170
Da Vinci as in the Leonardo from the village Vinci.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.490
What I mean is, Leonardo da Vinci.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:08.570
To put it simply, a noteworthy historical artist-pri.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.020
Oh? I see...

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.290
DaVinci.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.470
Ta-da!

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:18.790
Look-michelangelo.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.780
Nice-venusDeMilo!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:22.760
Complete-daVinci!

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.470
Capisce!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.380
So cute!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.840
She brought out my cute side!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:30.900
Creatively original.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:31.850
Thunderous applause.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.810
Sunflower!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.270
I can feel the Winds of Andalucia-pri.

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:43.060
It's embarrassing to have you praise me like that-deskel.

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:44.860
It makes me so happy-deskel.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.910
That's amazing, Ajimi-chan!

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.640
It's still hard to understand you, though.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:51.420
They're pretty good-pri.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.830
You could use them for wanted posters-pri.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:55.560
Now that you mention it!

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:59.280
Ajimi, you're with the police, aren't you?

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.040
You don't need to hide it from us.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:05.600
You decided to not dress like a policewoman so the culprit wouldn't catch on, right?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.930
Oh! That makes sense.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:08.260
Come on, girls...

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.310
Did something happen?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.480
Oh my, how terrible.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:26.190
This is where the clue was found?

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.660
An eerie picture drawn on the ground...

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.470
This is the seventh.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:34.320
Hey, Mega-nii!

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.870
Did something happen?

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.580
Be a good kid and don't imitate this.
Practical jokes are bad.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.190
Rina-chan, make it nice and clean.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:46.300
Hang in there, Rina-chan!

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:51.390
There have been other jokes like this one.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.090
Infuriating!

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:55.010
Graffiti is bad-dechin!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.430
So says someone who just drew on a wall-pri.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.230
Bad-houseOfMedici!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.400
Bad-daVinci!

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.080
Listen when people talk-pri!

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.190
Bad-completely.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.670
Plum-delicious.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:07.280
It's possible that this is also the work of Phantom Thief Genius.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:07.820
Oh?

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.880
How so?

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:12.720
Well, it's just my intuition.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:16.620
Don't you think Phantom Thief Genius is the only person who would do this?

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:19.170
But why are they doing it?

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:22.170
Well, if we're able to catch them,
we might be able to figure that out.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:24.280
Let's leave this to the police.

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:25.880
Now then, I must be off.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.270
All right!

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.970
Let's go catch him!

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:32.800
Vinci?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.350
Whether it was Phantom Thief Genius or not,

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.510
what's important is catching the culprit.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:38.400
Right, Ajimi?

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.930
Important! Noble! Nobleman! Great man!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:43.540
A great man is an admirable man-daVinci!

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.360
To keep peace in PriPara!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:48.860
Let's set out!

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.320
Let's Go!

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.600
Let's Gauguin!

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.080
Let's Going My Way!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.940
Let's Gogh!

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.490
Let it Go!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.830
They're competing...
Let it Go!

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.790
Let's da Vinci!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.960
Derodero Derosaimu!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.640
Meat buns are delicious!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.720
This autumn appetite-nano!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:16.140
A suspicious individual has suddenly been found!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.180
Apprehend her!

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:18.970
Devi?!

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:21.180
What hast thou done?!

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:24.720
I was just drawing my magic circle-dearu!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:27.440
This is the autumn of summoning a demon from the depths of hell!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.900
Aloma may be a demon, but she's not bad!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:34.130
If you want to arrest Aloma, you'll need to give Mikan three pizza buns!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.030
Hey!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.410
Is three pizza buns all I'm worth to thee?!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.620
Just trying it out-nano! Just trying it out-nano!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.920
Yet another suspicious individual found!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:45.830
Apprehend her!

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:49.490
Chanko was just drawing a sumo arena-chanko!

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.300
It's the autumn of sports-chanko!

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:54.600
Come on, Ajimi, pull it together.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.260
Each one of them have been innocent!

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:00.110
Will you really be able to catch the phantom thief like this?

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:01.580
Huh?

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:05.940
But why oh why would Ajimi catch the phantom thief-daVinci?

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:09.060
Why would you?
You're with the police, aren't you, Ajimi-chan?

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.980
Porisu?

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:14.090
Poorisu?

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:14.890
Porokku?

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:17.410
It looks like she's trying to figure something out.
Porokku?

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:23.360
But this seems to be the first time she's reacted to anything we've said.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.080
Finally-pri?

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:29.250
Ajimi is not police-daVinci!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.550
Don't lie!

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:33.050
Ajimi is not lying-rousseauDaVinci!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.110
You're really not?

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:36.170
See.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:38.010
So you're not undercover...

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.580
I'm not-uccello!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.220
I'm not the police-daVinci!

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:43.430
See? I told you so-pri.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:45.390
No way!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.350
Hmm.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.560
No way...

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.520
Pushuu~.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.480
You're not?!

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:07.310
So you're not with the police.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.330
Then I wonder who is with them.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.540
Niyaha-daVinci.

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:14.000
It doesn't really matter. Let's get going.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.740
Henri-henri?

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.220
Hold on-henriMatisseDaVinci!

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:19.460
What is it?

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.000
You're not with the police, right?

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.180
Then it's okay.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:27.940
It'll be impossible for us to catch this mischievous perpetrator in addition to the phantom thief-pri.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:31.840
It is still too early to give up-daVinci!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:33.440
Ajimi-chan!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.650
Let's go go go to Christina's World-daVinci!

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:38.570
Wait up!

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:42.330
This is the crime scene from earlier.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.540
They sure did clean it up-pri.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:49.100
Where is it? Where is it-daVinci?

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.270
Ajimi-chan, what are you doing?

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:52.480
Observing, observing!

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.920
What's important is observing-daVinci!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.670
Observing...

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:01.130
Mega-nii and Principal Ookanda already cleaned up the area.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.430
It's pointless. Pointless I say.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.120
Hold on-statueOfDavid.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.180
There's more here-daVinci!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:06.680
Hm?

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:07.390
Here!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.890
Here-daVinci! DaVinci!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.310
Ah!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.490
Spit it out.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:22.410
What if it was poisoned?!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.880
I was half choking-daVinci.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.820
But! But-claudeMonet!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.450
It all makes sense-daVinci!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.840
Eh?!

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.710
This is...

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:34.830
...a sunflower seed-daVinci!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.670
A sunflower seed?!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:40.580
What? So you're saying that the culprit is a hamster?

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.270
Isn't that a bit ridiculous?

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:42.890
Huh?

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.670
Eh?

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.560
Huh?

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.770
Uh...?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:51.220
Oh my?

00:11:54.610 --> 00:12:06.770
My oh my oh my oh my!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.080
Leonardo da Vinci!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.240
D-D-DaVinci! D-D-D-DaVinci!

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.770
I saw it-daVinci!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.080
Thank you, da Vinci-sama!

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:25.680
DaVinci!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.310
Bam!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.730
Ajimi-chan!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.340
Ajimi-chan.

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.970
What is it this time?

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:41.740
Huh?

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:43.790
Ah!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.200
A hamster?!

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.940
Better yet, this!

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:50.000
This-daVinci!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.910
They're the sunflower seed shells-raphael.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.780
Sunflower seeds you say?

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:56.630
I get it! Sunflower seeds!

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.150
Which means...

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.440
This hamster! This hamster!

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.590
This! This-kokoschkaKandinskyDaVinci!

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:07.800
Uh-huh...

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.970
Well done, Ajimi-san.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:17.120
Yes, those eerie pictures on the ground were created by him.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:18.190
Huh?!

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.040
Ta-da!

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:25.360
You solved the case that was hard to see through like opaque watercolour.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.640
Exactly!

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:29.160
Ajimi did it-raphaelDaVinci!

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.140
Huh?

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.480
What's the meaning of this?

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:32.870
Explain it properly-pri.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:34.580
Sure thing.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:42.010
This is the inspector that the PriPara Police dispatched upon my request.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:42.800
Eh?!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:43.800
Inspector?!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.530
Him?!

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:46.650
Yes.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:50.760
He's on the look out for Phantom Thief Genius and has been staking out the place.

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:52.660
Which is when...

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.940
That means those eerie pictures...

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.280
Yes.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:05.790
The sunflower seed shells just
happened to get scattered like that.

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:06.840
Eh?!

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:07.810
What the heck?!

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.900
Will an inspector like him be able to handle it?

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:11.660
He'll be fine.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.970
Besides, I've also been patrolling.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:18.190
Ham-senpai also has other large issues he's responsible for.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:20.880
As such, I thought I should find him a partner.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.310
A partner?

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:27.910
If someone was able to figure out that
Ham-senpai created those eerie pictures,

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:31.720
their insight and observation skills would be of great use to the police.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.800
What do you mean-daVinci?

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:35.430
Hm?

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.390
It's a police badge.

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:41.880
I can have it-daVinci?

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.960
You've been recognised as his partner.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:52.770
Please catch the phantom thief as part of the Parajuku PriPara Police.

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:58.520
PriPara is a free place where power and money don't hold sway.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:01.000
We must not succumb to anyone!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.480
Okay! Okay!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.480
Ajimi will do it-chagall!

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:08.850
If you think Ajimi has the talent to be in the police-daVinci.

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:11.020
You got it. You can leave it to Ajimi-daVinci!

